# Every `npm run test:*` verification bundle lands in its own throwaway output
# directory (see the `vite build --ssr` scripts). One pattern covers them all —
# previously only a few explicit names were listed, so a new check such as
# `.verify-fee` showed up in GitHub Desktop as hundreds of files to upload.
.verify-*/
*.local

